OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle from hit Spider-Man film
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe original military vehicle used in
OL,7,Fthe latest Spider-Man film and
OL,8,Fcurrently housed in Northamptonshire is
OL,9,Fto be auctioned.
OL,11,FKnown on screen as DD6, the machine is
OL,12,Ffeatured in a major chase sequence in
OL,13,FSpider-Man: Brand New Day, alongside
OL,14,Fthe web-slinging superhero played by
OL,15,FTom Holland.
OL,17,FIt is currently being kept at a
OL,18,Fmilitary vehicle experience company
OL,19,Fbased in Brackley, which has been home
OL,20,Fto other iconic motors from films
OL,21,Fincluding Fast and Furious 6 and Black
OL,22,FWidow.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
