OL,3,GNEWSAVehicle from hit Spider-Man film
OL,4,Ato be auctioned
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicle will be auctioned online by
OL,7,FHumbert & Ellis on 25 November with a
OL,8,Fguide price of between #50,000 and
OL,9,F#70,000.
